<p
  style="color:#4b5563;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;"
>{{#if firstName}}Hi {{firstName}},{{else}}Hello,{{/if}}</p>
<h2
  style="color:#1a1a1a;margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:20px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;"
>Sign-In Method Removed</h2>
<p
  style="color:#4b5563;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 24px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;"
>{{#if byAdmin}}An administrator reset two-factor authentication on your account. You will set it up again from your profile or at your next sign-in.{{else if mfaTurnedOff}}Two-factor authentication was turned off for your account.{{else}}A passkey or security key was removed from your account.{{/if}}</p>
<p
  style="font-size:14px;color:#6b7280;line-height:1.6;margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;"
>{{#if isDriver}}If you did not make this change, sign in and reset your password at once, or contact {{companyName}} support.{{else}}If you did not make this change, sign in, change your password and contact your administrator at once.{{/if}}</p>
